  "details": "Hey guys, so iam working a lot with World particles that are connected to the wrist etc. when Iam in desktop the Joint keeps floating away over time but only local for yourself(when I move or reactivate the animation). You can test that with my new public models.\nFor other Users the Particles are on the right spot forever. I set the Rigidbody System up as always but it’s still there and I also tried it with Constraints but it’s the same Issue \nhttps://gyazo.com/94611f5935a8f2334be2df0b47da2a8c\nhttps://gyazo.com/e0bcc54553e5023063afa1b5a860bd5e\nWhen you walk or having a prone idle the particles are on the right spot again but when u press z or c again they´re somewhere random again. Please fix that I love working with world particles.\nThey are working fine in Full Body tracking.\nBuild : 916\nUsing the newest VRCSDK2",
